members +0x2b90..+0x2d68 are listed there as pending); ClientProxy2008.h declares Server::ClientProxy's base only.
ReplicatorStatsItem (0x180 bytes) is complete. Nothing here depends on sizeof(Replicator) or on the missing members:

Builds (document-swap flags, VS2008 RTM 21022, RakNet raknet30/Source after the document-swap includes; current
native headers only, no pending build):
